                                    <div class="col-lg-4 pt48 pb24 o_colored_level">
                                        <span class="fa fa-location-arrow text-o-color-1 fa-2x"/>
                                        <div class="s_hr pt8 pb16" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                        </div>
                                        <h3>
                                            <span class="h3-fs">
                                                <strong>ACCESSIBILITY</strong>
                                            </span>
                                        </h3>
                                        <p>
                                            Wheelchair-accessible entrance, elevator access to all levels, and reserved seating available upon request at booking.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 pt48 pb24 o_colored_level">
                                        <span class="fa fa-automobile text-o-color-1 fa-2x"/>
                                        <div class="s_hr pt8 pb16" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <h3>PARKING</h3>
                                        <p>Paid public parking available at Forum Parking, a 3-minute walk from the venue. Limited accessible parking spots located directly in front of the main entrance.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 pt48 pb24 o_colored_level">
                                        <span class="fa fa-glass text-o-color-1 fa-2x"/>
                                        <div class="s_hr pt8 pb16" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <h3>FOOD &amp;amp; DRINKS</h3>
                                        <p>Our lobby bar opens 1 hour before each performance and during intermission, offering a curated selection of wines, craft beers, and non-alcoholic beverages, along with coffee, tea, and light snacks.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="s_title pb0 o_colored_level pt64" data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_title" data-name="Title">
                            <div class="s_allow_columns container">
                                <h2 style="text-align: center;">YOUR&amp;nbsp;<span class="text-o-color-1">QUESTIONS</span></h2>
                                <p style="text-align: center;">
                                    <br/>
                                </p>
                                <p style="text-align: center;" class="lead">Our FAQ is designed to help you plan your experience smoothly, so you can focus on enjoying the music.<strong><br/>If you don’t see the answer you’re looking for, our team is always here to help.</strong></p>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <div class="s_hr o_colored_level pb16 pt16" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                        </div>
                        <section class="s_faq_collapse pt32 pb32 o_colored_level" data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_faq_collapse" data-name="FAQ Block">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="row s_nb_column_fixed o_grid_mode" data-row-count="7">
                                    <div class="s_col_no_bgcolor o_grid_item g-height-7 g-col-lg-10 col-lg-10" data-name="Accordion Box" style="grid-area: 1 / 2 / 8 / 12; z-index: 2;">
                                        <div data-name="Accordion" class="s_accordion">
                                            <div id="myCollapse" class="accordion accordion-flush">
                                                <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                                                    <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none justify-content-between collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="accordion-button865428_1" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab865428_1" aria-controls="myCollapseTab865428_1">
                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">
                                                            <p class="lead">How can I purchase tickets for upcoming events?</p>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab865428_1" aria-labelledby="accordion-button865428_1">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>You can buy tickets directly through our website by visiting the <i>Events</i> section and selecting your preferred show. Each event page displays real-time availability and seating options. Tickets can also be purchased at our on-site box office during opening hours or through our official ticketing partners. We strongly recommend buying tickets only from authorized sellers to avoid scams or invalid entries. Once your purchase is complete, you will receive a confirmation email with your e-ticket, which you can show on your phone or print for entry.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                                                    <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none justify-content-between collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="accordion-button865428_2" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab865428_2" aria-controls="myCollapseTab865428_2">
                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">
                                                            <p class="lead">Do you offer accessible seating or support for guests with disabilities?</p>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab865428_2" aria-labelledby="accordion-button865428_2">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>Yes. Our concert hall is fully equipped to welcome guests with reduced mobility or special needs. We offer dedicated accessible seating areas, wheelchair spaces, and companion seats. If you require assistance upon arrival, our staff can guide you from the entrance to your seat. Please contact us in advance if you need specific accommodations, such as hearing aid support systems, early access, or personalized assistance, so we can provide the best experience possible.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                                                    <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none justify-content-between collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="accordion-button865428_3" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab865428_3" aria-controls="myCollapseTab865428_3">
                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">
                                                            <p class="lead">What time do the doors open before a concert?</p>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab865428_3" aria-labelledby="accordion-button865428_3">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>Doors typically open <b>60 minutes before the performance</b> to allow guests to find their seats, purchase refreshments, and enjoy the pre-show atmosphere at a comfortable pace. For major events or sold-out shows, we may open the doors earlier to ensure smooth entry. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes before the concert begins to avoid queues and allow time for security checks. Opening times will always be indicated on your ticket and event confirmation email.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                                                    <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none justify-content-between collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="myCollapseBtn1763393693882" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab1763393693881" aria-controls="myCollapseTab1763393693881">
                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">
                                                            <p class="lead">Is there parking available near the venue?</p>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab1763393693881" aria-labelledby="myCollapseBtn1763393693882">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>Yes. Several parking options are available within walking distance of the concert hall, including public parking lots and private garages. Some events may offer discounted parking rates—details will be provided on the event page. We also encourage the use of public transportation, as we are conveniently connected to major bus, tram, and metro lines. Bicycle racks are available near the entrance for guests arriving by bike.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                                                    <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none justify-content-between collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="myCollapseBtn1763393693884" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab1763393693883" aria-controls="myCollapseTab1763393693883">
                                                        <span class="flex-grow-1">
                                                            <p class="lead">Can I bring food, drinks, or bags inside the concert hall?</p>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </button>
                                                    <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#myCollapse" role="region" id="myCollapseTab1763393693883" aria-labelledby="myCollapseBtn1763393693884">
                                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                                            <p>For safety and comfort, outside food and beverages are not permitted inside the venue. A selection of drinks and snacks is available at the bar before the show and during intermission. Small personal bags are allowed, but large backpacks, luggage, or oversized items may be denied entry. All bags are subject to security checks. To ensure a smooth experience, we advise guests to travel light and review any specific restrictions listed on the event page.</p>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <div class="s_hr o_colored_level pb104 pt88 d-lg-block d-none o_snippet_mobile_invisible" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator" data-invisible="1">
                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="s_hr o_colored_level d-lg-none o_snippet_desktop_invisible pb32 pt48" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator" data-invisible="1">
                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </field>
